        "metadata": {
            "kira_final": "Implementation complete and verified. `/app/headless_terminal.py` contains `HeadlessTerminal(BaseTerminal)`:\n\n- **Interactive bash**: spawns `/bin/bash --login -i` via pexpect, so startup files (`/etc/profile`, `~/.bashrc`) are sourced — verified with `shopt -q login_shell` → `LOGINOK`.\n- **`send_keystrokes(keystrokes, wait_sec)`**: sends raw characters; control chars like `\"\\x03\"` (Ctrl-C) pass through verbatim — verified interrupting a running `sleep 10` (saw `^C` and prompt return).\n- **Interactive programs**: tested by launching a nested Python REPL and executing code in it.\n- Extras: `read_output()`, `is_alive()`, `close()`, context-manager support, TERM fallback (`dumb`), prompt synchronization at startup. Dependency `pexpect` installed into system Python.",
            "session_id": "tb-8c4e346162"
        }
